WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,520
I'm over fifty and I'm not old yet

2
00:00:03,510 --> 00:00:06,070
The Tamu tribe has managed to become so strong over the years

3
00:00:06,550 --> 00:00:09,230
Not bad compared to those big old tribes

4
00:00:10,080 --> 00:00:11,840
Maybe when I'm alive

5
00:00:12,120 --> 00:00:14,560
I can touch the threshold of a super large tribe

6
00:00:14,920 --> 00:00:16,840
Hundreds of tribes throughout the Northern Barbarians

7
00:00:17,080 --> 00:00:19,560
There are only four super large ones in Huang Ting

8
00:00:20,160 --> 00:00:23,120
If I could make it, I would be the fifth one

9
00:00:23,670 --> 00:00:26,390
Or the fifth one independent of Huang Ting

10
00:00:26,710 --> 00:00:30,030
Just thinking about this location makes my blood boil.

11
00:00:30,230 --> 00:00:32,190
It’s a pity that we can’t count on the next generation.

12
00:00:32,750 --> 00:00:35,670
None of the three standing in the corner are successful.

13
00:00:37,950 --> 00:00:40,590
Unless I can recreate it or wait for the next generation

14
00:00:41,620 --> 00:00:44,940
I'll have to support myself for a few more decades.

15
00:00:45,020 --> 00:00:46,740
I really saw a ghost in the past few months

16
00:00:47,300 --> 00:00:49,140
The third prince of the Luoyun tribe is dead

17
00:00:49,340 --> 00:00:52,220
One hundred thousand swordsmen were robbed, and his team was ambushed.

18
00:00:52,700 --> 00:00:55,580
Pretending to be a sword, it’s like a pair of eyes are staring at me

19
00:00:57,110 --> 00:00:59,990
It made me a joke, and our alliance was almost ruined.
